New: parallel::shared::Triangulation with artificial cells now behaves like
parallel::distributed::Triangulation: degrees of freedom are only enumerated
on locally owned and ghost cells, and SolutionTransfer sends data to the new
owners of cells after repartitioning. This makes adaptive mesh refinement
with SolutionTransfer work on such triangulations.
<br>
